racterization, wafer probe evaluation, and ATE test development. Drive silicon quality, yield improvement, characterization, and production readiness while collaborating with Design, DV, DFT, Product Engineering, ATE, Applications, Firmware, and Quality teams. This enhancement aligns with responsibilities reflected in internal validation and evaluation materials.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Post\\-Silicon \\& System Validation** \n\n\n\n* Lead silicon bring\\-up and debug activities for complex SoCs.\n* Own functional, subsystem, and system\\-level validation.\n* Develop validation plans, test specifications, and coverage strategies.\n* Drive customer use\\-case and scenario validation.\n* Perform stress, reliability, concurrency, and corner\\-case validation.\n\n\n\n**Bench Characterization** \n\n\n\n* Define and execute silicon characterization plans across PVT (Process, Voltage, Temperature) corners.\n* Characterize timing, performance, power, thermal, and analog parameters.\n* Correlate silicon measurements against simulation models and specifications.\n* Analyze silicon variation and identify design/process\\-related issues.\n* Generate characterization reports for product release and datasheet validation.\n\n\n\n**Wafer Probe / CP Evaluation** \n\n\n\n* Manage wafer\\-level electrical characterization and evaluation.\n* Drive correlation between wafer probe, package test, and system validation results.\n* Analyze yield excursions and process\\-related failures.\n* Support DFT and Product Engineering teams in test coverage improvement.\n* Develop screening methodologies and guard\\-band recommendations.\n\n\n\n**ATE Validation** \n\n\n\n* Collaborate with DFT and Product Engineering teams on ATE strategies.\n* Review and optimize wafer sort and final test coverage.\n* Validate production test programs and characterization limits.\n* Drive ATE correlation with bench and system\\-level measurements.\n* Support yield ramp, test time optimization, and cost reduction initiatives.\n\n\n\n**Leadership \\& Program Management** \n\n\n\n* Lead global validation teams and vendor resources.\n* Manage schedules, resource planning, risk assessment, and execution.\n* Mentor engineers in debug, characterization, and validation methodologies.\n* Drive root\\-cause analysis and cross\\-functional issue resolution.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Qualifications** \n\n\n\n\n**Required Skills \\& Experience** \n\n\n\n* 18\\+ years in SoC/System Validation, Characterization, Product Engineering, or ATE domains.\n* Experience across the complete silicon lifecycle:\n* Wafer Probe (CP)\n* Package Test / Final Test\n* Bench Characterization\n* Post\\-Silicon Functional Validation\n* System Validation\n* Customer Support \\& Failure Analysis\n\n\n\n**SoC Validation Expertise** \n\n\n\n* SoC bring\\-up and silicon debug\n* Functional and system validation\n* Use\\-case and scenario validation\n* Subsystem validation\n* Stress and reliability testing\n* Coverage planning and closure\n\n\n\n**Bench Characterization** \n\n\n\n* PVT characterization\n* Timing and performance measurements\n* Power and thermal characterization\n* Analog and mixed\\-signal evaluation\n* Datasheet parameter validation\n* Correlation analysis\n\n\n\n**Wafer Probe \\& Product Engineering** \n\n\n\n* Wafer sort (CP) methodologies\n* Yield analysis and yield improvement\n* Parametric characterization\n* DFT fundamentals\n* Screening and guard\\-banding techniques\n* Failure analysis flow\n\n\n\n**ATE Expertise** \n\n\n\n* Advantest / Teradyne platforms\n* Wafer sort and final test programs\n* Test coverage analysis\n* Correlation between ATE, Bench, and System results\n* Characterization limit setting\n* Production qualification support\n\n\n\n**Protocol \\& Interface Validation** \n\n\n\n* I3C, I2C, SPI, UART\n* CAN/CAN\\-FD, LIN, FlexRay\n* Ethernet, PCIe, USB\n* DDR, LPDDR\n* MIPI CSI/DSI\n\n\n\n**Debug \\& Lab Equipment** \n\n\n\n* JTAG / Lauterbach\n* Oscilloscope\n* Logic Analyzer\n* Protocol Analyzers\n* Thermal Chambers\n* Power Analyzers\n* High\\-speed measurement equipment\n\n\n\n**Software \\& Automation** \n\n\n\n* Python\n* C/C\\+\\+\n* Shell scripting\n* Test automation frameworks\n* Data analytics and visualization tools"},{"title":"Sr. Consultant - GRC AC (Access Control) Job Job Details | Yash Technologies","company":"Yash Technologies","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-25","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/sr-consultant-grc-ac-access-control-job-job-details-yash-technologies-yash-technologies-hyderabadsecunderabad-6-8-years-jobid-AXr6S2Jye3tzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"6-8 Yrs"},{"title":"Regional Manager - Corporate Leasing/Sen...","company":"Bajaj finserv","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-25","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/regional-manager-corporate-leasingsen-bajaj-finserv-hyderabadsecunderabad-3-6-years-jobid-1i9PER8rNBNzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"3-6 Yrs"},{"title":"Manager - Debt Management Services - Rur...","company":"Bajaj finserv","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-25","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/manager-debt-management-services-rur-bajaj-finserv-hyderabadsecunderabad-5-7-years-jobid-QQ0S83t__SLASH__gSdzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"5-7 Yrs"},{"title":"Senior Lead Technology Business Services Consultant (Process Excellence, WFM, Reporting)","company":"Wells Fargo","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-25","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/senior-lead-technology-business-services-consultant-process-excellence-wfm-reporting-wells-fargo-hyderabadsecunderabad-7-10-years-jobid-HcP9cIxsJZBzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"7-10 Yrs"},{"title":"Senior Business Execution Consultant - Originations And Portfolio Management Transformation-1","company":"Wells Fargo","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-25","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detai